"file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "463337ec68298752e57b253f36ce61dc23deb2b60c656593886ee6b3c0850fb4" "basis" 1507 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-128467" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "r=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]+s[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}],\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "463337ec68298752e57b253f36ce61dc23deb2b60c656593886ee6b3c0850fb4" "basis" 1507 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find a normal vector to the plane\n\n$$\nr=[\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+t[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]+s[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}],\\,t,\\,s\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "463337ec68298752e57b253f36ce61dc23deb2b60c656593886ee6b3c0850fb4" "basis" 1507 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the parametric equation, we have that $v=⟨-5,1,1⟩$ and $w=⟨3,1,-2⟩$ are parallel to the plane.\n\nNow, we need to find a normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of $v$ and $w$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -5 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-3i-7j-8k \\\\  & =⟨-3,-7,-8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-3,-7,-8⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "463337ec68298752e57b253f36ce61dc23deb2b60c656593886ee6b3c0850fb4" "basis" 1507 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "ec258eb6c94dc1549530bb4230d77e0f72728e5d4939a4eec01690d066a25c19" "basis" 1507 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/state.json" "file_sha256" "463337ec68298752e57b253f36ce61dc23deb2b60c656593886ee6b3c0850fb4" "basis" 1507 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14041396/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-33822" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨-3,-7,-8⟩"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linea