me/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14077819/state.json" "file_sha256" "d526e2393a1241fb2502cebde1d4789dafbd406b3bdda2fe62cfc9e3da8b67a7"} {"question" "q-33818" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "From the parametric equation, we have that $v=⟨-2,-7,5⟩$ and $w=⟨2,12,5⟩$ are parallel to the plane.\n\nNow, we need to find a normal vector of the plane. To do that, we use the cross product of $v$ and $w$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =v\\times w \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -7 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\\times [\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 12 & 5\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =-95i+20j-10k \\\\  & =⟨-95,20,-10⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, a normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨-95,20,-10⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14077819/state.json" "file_sha256" "d526e2393a1241fb2502cebde1d4789dafbd406b3bdda2fe62cfc9e3da8b67a7"} {"question" "q-33818" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14077819/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "bac8017a7b1f2806a0606b007b551ced5b2fcb760a3ff30eee3030fcbab782b0"} {"question" "q-33818" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14077819/state.json" "file_sha256" "d526e2393a1241fb2502cebde1d4789dafbd406b3bdda2fe62cfc9e3da8b67a7"} {"question" "q-33818" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-2,-7,5⟩"] ["math" "⟨-4,-84,25⟩"] ["math" "⟨-59,10,-20⟩"] ["math" "⟨-95,20,-10⟩"] ["math" "⟨2,0,-1⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacade